*	arith_loop_twin.sno -- fixed-count accumulator loop. Twin: snocone/arith_loop.sc.
*	Named _twin: arith_loop.sno already exists as a different, load-bearing kernel
*	(consumed by the fixed-iteration harness via its own *BENCH directive) -- this is
*	a separate, unrelated file for the Snocone triangulator only.
*	bottleneck: loop dispatch + scalar arithmetic.
	N = 0
	I = 1
LOOP	N = N + I
	I = I + 1
	LE(I, 300000)					:S(LOOP)
	OUTPUT = N
END
